    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Falling is the cause of rising.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does it hurt? Impossible, you fell on sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SauteorFaute</strong> is a punishing game where you need to jump to reach the end. This game is nothing more complicated than that: two keys, one to move forward and the other to jump. Not hard, right? Well, you're wrong! This game will challenge your jumping skills. But don\u2019t worry, you\u2019ll have all the time you need to think about your strategy... when you\u2019ve fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world has always been hidden beneath a mysterious sky. In reality, we know nothing about this world: only dunes as far as the eye can see and a ceiling that hides most of the sky. But then, what lies behind this false ceiling? Perhaps magnificent treasures, or floating islands like in fantastical tales... One thing is certain: to discover it, there\u2019s only one way: jump.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Falling is the cause of rising.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does it hurt? Impossible, you fell on sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SauteorFaute</strong> is a punishing game where you need to jump to reach the end. This game is nothing more complicated than that: two keys, one to move forward and the other to jump. Not hard, right? Well, you're wrong! This game will challenge your jumping skills. But don\u2019t worry, you\u2019ll have all the time you need to think about your strategy... when you\u2019ve fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world has always been hidden beneath a mysterious sky. In reality, we know nothing about this world: only dunes as far as the eye can see and a ceiling that hides most of the sky. But then, what lies behind this false ceiling? Perhaps magnificent treasures, or floating islands like in fantastical tales... One thing is certain: to discover it, there\u2019s only one way: jump.</p>",
    "short_description": "SauteorFaute is a punishing game where every jump counts. Move with one key, jump with the other, but be careful, this game will test your jumping skills. Get ready to think about every move... especially after each fall. If you dare to jump!",
